&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALEM, Ore. --&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Alexander&amp;nbsp;Elsherbini, 29, of Salem, was arrested on February 18, 2026, following a shooting incident that occurred on January 17, 2026, at approximately 6:55 p.m.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

