&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;Editors:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;OHA and OHSU medical experts will hold a media briefing&amp;nbsp;at 11 a.m.&amp;nbsp;today&amp;nbsp;to give an update on measles in Oregon and&amp;nbsp;a new measles&amp;nbsp;data&amp;nbsp;tracking&amp;nbsp;tool.&amp;nbsp;Reporters can join via Zoom at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW122863530 BCX8" href="https://www.zoomgov.com/j/1610610638?pwd=n3GjYbKXXcWY2WwPEVd2CoE70qhZ1k.1&amp;amp;utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;this link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;; a&amp;nbsp;livestream for the public is available via YouTube at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW122863530 BCX8" href="https://youtube.com/live/cEGIWRTY8MM?utm_medium=email&amp;amp;utm_source=govdelivery" rel="noopener" style="color: rgb(6, 66, 118); text-decoration-line: none; text-size-adjust: 100%;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;this link&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="background-color:#FFFF00"&gt;.&amp;nbsp;The&amp;nbsp;YouTube&amp;nbsp;livestream will be recorded and can be viewed later.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

