&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SALEM, Ore. &mdash;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;On February 22, 2026, Cristian Mercado, 31, of Salem, was arrested following a violation of a restraining order at a residence&amp;nbsp;located&amp;nbsp;in the 4900 block of Periwinkle Drive SE.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
