&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;Officers&amp;nbsp;contained&amp;nbsp;the house and attempted communication for an extended period; however, Mercado would only stay on the phone for short periods, hindering negotiation efforts. Salem SWAT&amp;nbsp;and the Crisis Negotiations Team&amp;nbsp;were&amp;nbsp;called to the scene.&amp;nbsp;At 11:45&amp;nbsp;p.m.&amp;nbsp;Mercado&amp;nbsp;finally&amp;nbsp;surrendered without&amp;nbsp;further&amp;nbsp;incident.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
