&lt;p style="text-align:center"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prolific Property Offender Sentenced to Over Five Years in Prison&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
