&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;The vehicle soon left the parking lot and a deputy attempted a traffic stop. The vehicle fled, as expected. The Trooper successfully deployed spike strips, deflating 3 tires and slowing the vehicle to around 25 miles per hour. The vehicle turned into a parking lot off E. Hunter Road and was pinned against a curb. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
