&lt;div class="_1mf _1mj" style="position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: inherit;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:inherit"&gt;As deputies cleared the property, Sprinkle attempted to flee on foot while armed with a knife. He was initially pursued by K9 Ripp, but encountered a detective on perimeter who deployed a taser. Sprinkle dropped the knife and was arrested without further incident. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

