&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;The&amp;nbsp;juvenile&amp;nbsp;suspect, who also had a Probation Violation Warrant&amp;nbsp;through&amp;nbsp;Oregon Youth Authority, was lodged at the Marion County Juvenile Detention&amp;nbsp;Center&amp;nbsp;on multiple charges, including Robbery in the First Degree,&amp;nbsp;Unlawful Possession of a Weapon, and Unlawful Possession of a&amp;nbsp;Short-Barreled&amp;nbsp;Firearm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:11pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
