&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;U.S. Marshals also located three additional wanted persons: Christopher Snyder, 33, who had a parole violation warrant out of Douglas County, and Victoria Hernandez, 21, who had a Failure to Appear warrant for Felon in Possession of a Firearm out of Linn County, along with Kayla Rose, 39, who was arrested on a Failure to Appear warrant for Assault in the Fourth Degree out of Benton County. All five were taken into custody without incident and will be returned to the counties where their warrants originated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
