&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;While at the residence,&amp;nbsp;U.S.&amp;nbsp;Marshals discovered firearms and drug paraphernalia, prompting them to call the Special Investigations Unit and request&amp;nbsp;assistance. Salem detectives&amp;nbsp;assisted&amp;nbsp;with transporting those in custody and obtaining a search warrant for the residence. This search resulted in the seizure of a small amount of suspected methamphetamine and fentanyl, as well as three firearms, body armor, and various ammunition and accessories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial nova light,arial nova light_embeddedfont,arial nova light_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
