&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;&ldquo;I&rsquo;m excited to join OnPoint and be part of a credit union that prioritizes&amp;nbsp;the&amp;nbsp;financial well-being of&amp;nbsp;its&amp;nbsp;members&amp;nbsp;in everything it does,&rdquo; White&amp;nbsp;said. &ldquo;That focus, including OnPoint&rsquo;s commitment to education and community investment, aligns closely with my approach to leadership.&amp;nbsp;I look forward to working with the&amp;nbsp;executive team&amp;nbsp;to support the credit union&rsquo;s financial strength and continued&amp;nbsp;growth.&rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
