&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif"&gt;In addition to her professional background, White&amp;nbsp;has a strong&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;community service. She has served as a board member,&amp;nbsp;treasurer&amp;nbsp;and secretary for Girls on the Run of Greater Oregon since&amp;nbsp;2020, providing financial oversight for the nonprofit. White also volunteered as a coach with the organization for&amp;nbsp;nearly a&amp;nbsp;decade, mentoring elementary school girls and supporting programs that build confidence,&amp;nbsp;character&amp;nbsp;and lifelong skills through physical activity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
